śramayātrāvidhi. NW. 106. 172.\n[]", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Bhaktiratnāvalī. NP. V, 104.\n Haribhaktisamāgama. NP. V, 104.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Rūpadīpakapiṅgala. P. 17.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयकृष्ण son of Bālakṛṣṇa:\n Ajāmilopākhyāna. L. 810.\n Kṛṣṇastotra. L. 870.\n Govardhanadhṛtkṛṣṇacaritra. L. 812.\n Dhruvacarita. L. 869.\n Prahlādacarita. L. 870.\n Vāmanacitracarita. L. 1811.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयकृष्ण Vāmanacitracaritra. read L. 811.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयकृष्ण father of Haribhānu Śukla (Jātakālaṃkāraṭīkā).", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयकृष्ण son of Padmanābha, grandson of Harinātha,\npupil of Veṅkaṭakṛṣṇa:\n Mahāviṣṇor Mahāstutiḥ.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयकृष्ण younger brother of Mahādeva and Rāmakṛṣṇa.\nThey were sons of Raghunātha, grandsons of Gova-\nrdhana:\n C. on the Vaidikaprakriyā of the Siddhāntakau-\nmudī. Hz. Extr. p. 64.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Ratnamālāstava.\n Hariprārthanāstava and Hariprāptiprārthanāstava.\n Harimaṅgalagīta.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayakfsRatarkavagisa": [{"id": "jayakfzRatarkavAgISa", "headword": "जयकृष्णतर्कवागीश", "headword_slp1": "jayakfzRatarkavAgISa", "fold": "jayakfsRatarkavagisa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "जयकृष्ण तर्कवागीश\n Śrāddhadarpaṇa. L. 1653.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayakfsRamOnin": [{"id": "jayakfzRamOnin", "headword": "जयकृष्णमौनिन्", "headword_slp1": "jayakfzRamOnin", "fold": "jayakfsRamOnin", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "जयकृष्ण मौनिन् son of Raghunātha Bhaṭṭa, grandson of\nGovardhana Bhaṭṭa. He is often called Kṛṣṇa:\n Kārakavāda. L. 1900.\n Laghukaumudīṭīkā. NW. 50. 56. NW. I, 104.\n Vibhaktyarthanirṇaya. Khn. 48. K. 88.\n Vṛttidīpikā alaṃk. (?). K. 104.\n Vṛttidīpikā, philosophical grammar.\n Śabdārthatarkāmṛta.\n Śabdārthasāramañjarī.\n Śu