3.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयराम न्यायपञ्चानन भट्टाचार्य\n Kāvyaprakāśaṭīkā Rahasyadīpikā. Oudh XX, 96.\n Uddeśyavidheyabodhasthalīyavicāra. Rgb. 749.\n Kārakavyākhyā or Kārakavāda. Rgb. 752. Stein\n40. 136.\n Saṃnikarṣavāda. IO. 695.\n Laghu-saṃnikarṣavāda. IO. 1369.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayaramatarkavagisa": [{"id": "jayarAmatarkavAgISa", "headword": "जयरामतर्कवागीश", "headword_slp1": "jayarAmatarkavAgISa", "fold": "jayaramatarkavagisa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "जयराम तर्कवागीश\n Bhagavadgītārthasaṃgraha. Hall p. 118. Ben. 70.\nNW. 324.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayalaksmaRa": [{"id": "jayalakzmaRa", "headword": "जयलक्ष्मण", "headword_slp1": "jayalakzmaRa", "fold": "jayalaksmaRa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "Siddhāntaśiromaṇiṭīkā jy. Rādh 36. NW. 518.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayalaksmi": [{"id": "jayalakzmI", "headword": "जयलक्ष्मी", "headword_slp1": "jayalakzmI", "fold": "jayalaksmi", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "जयलक्ष्मी Narapatijayacaryāṭīkā, by Narapati.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयलक्ष्मी read by Harivaṃśa.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयलक्ष्मी Narapatijayacaryāṭīkā by Harivaṃśa Pāṭhaka.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayavarDana": [{"id": "jayavarDana", "headword": "जयवर्धन", "headword_slp1": "jayavarDana", "fold": "jayavarDana", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "जयवर्धन from Kāśmīr, poet. Śp. p. 31. Skm. Sbhv.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayavilasa": [{"id": "jayavilAsa", "headword": "जयविलास", "headword_slp1": "jayavilAsa", "fold": "jayavilasa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "जयविलास jy. by Gokulanātha. Mack. 126.\n C. Sarvatobhadracakravyākhyāna, an explanation\nof a part of it. Mack. 126.\n[]", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयविलास Sarvatobhadracakravyākhyāna by Gokula-\nnātha. IO. 2701.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayasarman": [{"id": "jayaSarman", "headword": "जयशर्मन्", "headword_slp1": "jayaSarman", "fold": "jayasarman", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "जयशर्मन् Quoted by Raghunandana.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayaseKarasuri": [{"id": "jayaSeKarasUri", "headword": "जयशेखरसूरि", "headword_slp1": "jayaSeKarasUri", "fold": "jayaseKarasuri", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "जयशेखर सूरि pupil of Mahendraprabha and co-disciple^1\nof Muniśekhara and Merutuṅga:\n Prabandhakośa. BP. 17.\n[1] Correction submitted by on 20210126. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/49.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayasinha": [{"id": "jayasiMha", "headword": "जयसिंह", "headword_slp1": "jayasiMha", "fold": "jayasinha", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "जयसिंह king (1094--1143), patron of Jayamaṅgala\n(Kaviśikṣā). Peters. 1, 68.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयसिंह king, son of Viṣṇusiṃha, son of Kṛṣṇasiṃha,\nson of Rāmasiṃha, son of Jayasiṃha, son of Mahā-\nsiṃha, son of Jagatsiṃha, son of Mānasiṃha. The\nfirst Jayasiṃha was patron of Ratnākara (Jayasiṃha-\nkalpadruma 1714). Oxf. 285^a. L. 1705.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयसिंह son of Sussaladeva, king of Kāśmīra, ruled\n1129--1150. Rājataraṅgiṇī 8, 241. Report p. 50.\nHe was patron of Maṅkha.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयसिंह king of Bāberī, patron of Gopīnātha Maunin\n(Siddhāntatattvasarvasva). Hall p. 77.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयसिंह of Jayapura (1730), patron of Jagannātha (Re-\nkhāgaṇita). Oxf. 340^b. Cambr. 75.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayasinhadeva": [{"id": "jayasiMhadeva", "headword": "जयसिंहदेव", "headword_slp1": "jayasiMhadeva", "fold": "jayasinhadeva", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "जयसिंह देव patron of Hemacandra (about 1150). Oxf.\n180^b.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयसिंहदेव by repute, author of:\n Jayamādhavamānasollāsa.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayasinhamisra": [{"id": "jayasiMhamiSra", "headword": "जयसिंहमिश्र", "headword_slp1": "jayasiMhamiSra", "fold": "jayasinhamisra", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "जयसिंह मिश्र\n Caṇḍīstotrāntargatamūrtirahasyaṭīkā. Peters. 2, 196.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayasinhasuri": [{"id": "jayasiMhasUri", "headword": "जयसिंहसूरि", "headword_slp1": "jayasiMhasUri", "fold": "jayasinhasuri", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "जयसिंह सूरि pupil of Mahendra:\n Nyāyatātparyadīpikā or Nyāyasāradīpikā. IO. 213.\nB. 4, 24.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayasinhasavai": [{"id": "jayasiMhasavAI", "headword": "जयसिंहसवाई", "headword_slp1": "jayasiMhasavAI", "fold": "jayasinhasavai", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "जयसिंह सवाई\n Yantrarāja jy. Bik. 351.\n Yantrarājaṭīkā. NW. 508.\n Yantrarājaracanāprakāra or Jayasiṃhakārikā. Peters.\n2, 194. Probably not different from the\nYantrarāja.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयसिंह सवाई\n Yantrarājopapatti.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayasinhakalpadruma": [{"id": "jayasiMhakalpadruma", "headword": "जयसिंहकल्पद्रुम", "headword_slp1": "jayasiMhakalpadruma", "fold": "jayasinhakalpadruma", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "जयसिंहकल्पद्रुम or व्रतकल्पद्रुम dh. composed by Ratnā-\nkara in 1714. Oxf. 285^a. Paris (D 54). L. 1705.\nBik. 396. NW. 156. SB. 146. Called Jayasiṃha-\nkalpataru in Ahalyākāmadhenu.\n C. Uddyota by Ratnākara. IO. 565. Ben. 132.\n141. Rādh 18. NP. I, 62. II, 144.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयसिंहकल्पद्रुम add IO. 565. 1026. 1337. 1550. 2772.\ndelete C. Uddyota, and take the numbers to above.\nSo much is certain that in several Mss. the work\nis called Jayasiṃhakalpadrumoddyota.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयसिंहकल्पद्रुम dh. by Ratnākara. Stein 89.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयसिंहकल्पद्रुम dh. by Ratnākara Bhaṭṭa, son of Deva-\nbhaṭṭa. Cs. 2, 68. Ulwar 1322.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयसिंहकल्पद्रुम dh. by Ratnākara, son of Devabhaṭṭa. AS\np. 67. Bd. 253. Lz. 517 (inc.). Peters. 5, 102. 6 p. 4.\n Jayasiṃhakalpadrume Pañcasūtrīvidhānam. Peters.\n6, 91.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayasinhaByudaya": [{"id": "jayasiMhAByudaya", "headword": "जयसिंहाभ्युदय", "headword_slp1": "jayasiMhAByudaya", "fold": "jayasinhaByudaya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "जयसिंहाभ्युदय Quoted by Ratnakaṇṭha Peters. 2, 17.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayasomagaRi": [{"id": "jayasomagaRi", "headword": "जयसोमगणि", "headword_slp1": "jayasomagaRi", "fold": "jayasomagaRi", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "Khaṇḍapraśastivṛtti. Bik. 708.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayaharikalpataru": [{"id": "jayaharikalpataru", "headword": "जयहरिकल्पतरु", "headword_slp1": "jayaharikalpataru", "fold": "jayaharikalpataru", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "जयहरिकल्पतरु a synonyme of the Jayasiṃhakalpadruma.\nAhalyākāmadhenu.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayaKyasanhita": [{"id": "jayAKyasaMhitA", "headword": "जयाख्यसंहिता", "headword_slp1": "jayAKyasaMhitA", "fold": "jayaKyasanhita", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "जयाख्यसंहिता āgama. Oppert II, 4016.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयाख्यसंहिता from the Nāradapañcarātra. Ulwar 2134.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जया or जयाख्यसंहिता from the Nāradapañcarātra. Peters.\n6, 492. Quoted by Utpala in Spandapradīpikā.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayaditya": [{"id": "jayAditya", "headword": "जयादित्य", "headword_slp1": "jayAditya", "fold": "jayaditya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "जयादित्य son of Rāṇiga, brother of Keśavārka.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयादित्य poet. Skm. Sbhv.\n[]", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयादित्य author of the four first adhyāyas of the Kā-\nśikāvṛtti. Quoted in Mādhavīyadhātuvṛtti, and by\nclouds of grammarians.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayanaka": [{"id": "jayAnaka", "headword": "जयानक", "headword_slp1": "jayAnaka", "fold": "jayanaka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "जयानक father of Alaka (Haravijayaṭīkā).", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayananda": [{"id": "jayAnanda", "headword": "जयानन्द", "headword_slp1": "jayAnanda", "fold": "jayananda", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "Muhūrtadīpa jy. B. 4, 176.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "जयानन्द son of Medhākara:\n Janmapaddhati.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayanandasuri": [{"id": "jayAnandasUri", "headword": "जयानन्दसूरि", "headword_slp1": "jayAnandasUri", "fold": "jayanandasuri", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "जयानन्द सूरि\n Liṅgānuśāsanavṛttyuddhāra, an extract from He-\nmacandra's Liṅgānuśāsanavṛtti. L. 2654. W.\n1693.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayaparvatikaTa": [{"id": "jayApArvatIkaTA", "headword": "जयापार्वतीकथा", "headword_slp1": "jayApArvatIkaTA", "fold": "jayaparvatikaTa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "जयापार्वतीकथा from Bhaviṣyottarapurāṇa. Ben. 56.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "jayapiqa": [{"id": "jayApIqa", "headword": "जयापीड", "headword_slp1": "jayApIqa", "fold": "jayapiqa"